title: "Your Agent Has Your Password. Who Has Your Refund?"
description: "Enormous engineering has gone into proving you authorized your AI agent. Almost none into deciding who pays when it gets it wrong."
subtitle: "Everyone built the part that proves you agreed. Nobody built the part where you get your money back."
slug: agent-password-refund
date: 2026-07-27
author: Vevina McAllister
eyebrow: Agentic Finance
tags: [agentic AI, payments, Regulation E, consumer protection, open banking, fintech, AI liability]
draft: false
hero: /blog/agent-password-refund/hibernia.jpg
og_image_alt: "A 1930s-style bank robbery outside the Hibernia Bank — masked figures, a cash bag, bystanders with hands raised"

# hero: renders on-page AND becomes the OG unfurl card — one line does both.
