# Ship only the .jpg — the .png stays local.

# ── beehiiv excerpt (build ignores this; use it when composing the newsletter) ──
# "Your agent buys the wrong thing at 3am. You call the bank — and the bank produces cryptographic
#  proof that you authorized it. Under Regulation E, that proof may be exactly what removes your
#  remedy. Six parties could have closed the gap. Every one deferred to someone else."

